,{"id":"lvzang-q-9bb1f633314b64979cc9","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-96a72f9a5d4490b33d3b","layer":"pei","quote":"术僭号，欲以尚为太尉；不敢显言，私使人讽之。尚无屈意，术亦不敢强也","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c3c03b97c67239fef561","start":341,"end":374},{"id":"lvzang-q-b0d516b73f94d43fcbb7","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-96a72f9a5d4490b33d3b","layer":"pei","quote":"建安初，尚逃还，为术所害","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c3c03b97c67239fef561","start":375,"end":387},{"id":"lvzang-q-f35bfbd2773044b7dabf","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-96a72f9a5d4490b33d3b","layer":"pei","quote":"尚，献帝初为兖州刺史，东之郡。而太祖已临兖州，尚南依袁术","attribution":"典略","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c3c03b97c67239fef561","start":312,"end":340}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
